GTG GGG ATC TAT CGC TAT TTT AAC ACA CAG GCC CTG CGC GAT GCC ATC TCT CAG GGC
GTC CCG GTT TAC CCG TTT GAA GAT CAA AAT CCG ACT TTC TTG AAA TCT GTG GCC
